# "Four or more card types among cards exiled with this creature" (CR 607.2a, 610.3): Bot1 casts the Curator on turn one, then Wheel of
# Fortune, which puts Bot2's whole hand (three Islands, an Ornithopter, a Lightning Bolt, a Sol Ring, a Demonic Tutor) into its
# graveyard. Two Islands exiled on turn one are one type: still 3/3. On turn three a third Island is still land only, the Ornithopter
# adds artifact and creature - four cards, three types, still 3/3 - and the Lightning Bolt makes four types: 7/7 with trample. An
# Ephemerate then blinks the Curator: it returns as a new object (CR 400.7) that nothing was exiled with, a 3/3 without trample,
# though all five cards are still in exile (beside the rebounding Ephemerate).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
